.TH xyrev-man 1  "xyrev-man " 
.SH NAME
xyrev\-man \- Render the manual, or write all command manuals to a directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxyrev\-man\fR [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Render the manual, or write all command manuals to a directory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
